Thought: The current best uses a robust median on a stable 5‑model pool. To see if a fitted weighting can improve, try inverse‑error weights on the same pool, which should give more influence to the lowest‑error models while still being robust to the unstable ranking.  
Action: weights_inverse_error  
Action Input: {"pool":"pool1","metric":"rmse"}

